2082 fire extinguisher. Set in an office environment, you will encounter fire emergencies and learn the techniques needed to handle them safely and effectively.\n\nKey Features:\n\nRealistic CO\u2082 fire extinguisher mechanics based on real-world operations.\n\nPerformance feedback to improve your reaction time and accuracy.\n\nPerfect for fire safety training, workplace preparation and VR enthusiasts.\n\nTake on the role of a fire safety hero and make sure you are ready for any emergency with CO\u2082 Extinguisher VR!\n\n#FireSafetyTraining, #VROfficeGame, #CO2Training", "short_description": "Practice your firefighting skills in VR! Master the CO\u2082 fire extinguisher to put out an office fire."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jone Sei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29443104322004668"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "26969579099373779"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1908200723189442"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1291915056150979"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1805481430114466"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "2143087756495095"}, {"